---
title: "1Zpresso — JX (Aluminum)"
description: "A full-size, aluminum-bodied hand grinder that grinds quickly and holds enough beans for a couple of cups."
date: "2026-10-27"
tags: ["grinder", "hand grinder"]
brand: "1Zpresso"
category: "Hand grinder"
---

The JX is a full-size grinder with an aluminum body. It has a bigger burr than the compact grinders on this list, which means fewer turns of the crank to get through a dose.

A good pick if you brew pour over or French press most mornings and want it done fast. Read more in [my hand grinder post](/coffee/reviews/hand-coffee-grinders).
